[0.000, "o", "rencing.\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  ## What it should do:\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  1. **Home page** (`/`) - Simple landing with two options:\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m     - \"Create Interview Room\" button for interviewers\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m     - \"Join as Candidate\" with a room code input\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  2. **Create Room page** (`/create`) - Interviewer flow:\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m     - Form to enter interview title and candidate name\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m     - On submit: creates a Digital Samba room via API, generates two JWT tokens (interviewer with\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  full permissions, candidate with limited permissions)\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m     - Shows the room code and two join links\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  3. **Interview Room page** (`/room/[roomI"]
