[0.000, "o", "[38;2;255;255;255m  - Interviewer: can record, share screen, manage participants\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  - Candidate: can share screen, no recording control\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  Build the complete application. Create all necessary files. Do not ask questions - make\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  reasonable decisions and proceed. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSearch\u001b[22m(pattern: \"**/*.{md,json,ts,tsx,js,jsx}\")\r\n  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m5 \u001b[22mfiles \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b(B\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSearch\u001b[22m(pattern: \".cursor/rules/*\")\r\n  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m0 \u001b[22mfiles \u001b(B\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSearch\u001b[22m(pattern: \".cursorrules\")\r\n  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m0 \u001b[22mfiles \u001b(B\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSearch\u001b[22m(pattern: \".github/copilot-instructions.md\")\r\n  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m0 \u001b[22mfiles \u001b(B\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1mRead\u001b[22m(.agents/skills/digital-samba/SKILL.md)\r\n  ⎿  Read \u001b[1m111"]
